#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:25
msgid "Clip Monitor elements"
msgstr "Prvky monitora klipu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:27
msgid ""
"The Clip Monitor displays the unedited\\ [#f1]_ clip that is currently "
"selected in the :doc:`Project Bin </project_and_asset_management/"
"project_bin>`. It has the same functions and options as the :ref:`ui-"
"monitors_project_monitor` except for the |kdenlive-add-clip| icon which adds "
"the clip zone to the Project Bin where it will appear as child clip "
"underneath the clip. See :ref:`ui-monitors_cm_clip_zone` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Monitor klipu zobrazuje neupravený\\ [#f1]_ klip, ktorý je aktuálne vybraný "
"v :doc:`zásobníku projektu </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`. Má "
"rovnaké funkcie a možnosti ako :ref:`ui-monitors_project_monitor`, s "
"výnimkou ikony |kdenlive-add-clip|, ktorá pridáva zónu klipu do zásobníka "
"projektu, kde sa zobrazí ako podradený klip pod klipom. Podrobnosti nájdete "
"v :ref:`ui-monitors_cm_clip_zone`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:35
msgid ""
"Video Stream indicator. Grab the icon to only put the video part of the "
"video into the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Indikátor video streamu. Uchopte ikonu, aby ste vložili do časovej osi iba "
"video časť videa."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:37
msgid ""
"Audio Stream indicator. Grab the icon to only put the audio part of the "
"video into the timeline."
msgstr ""
"Indikátor audio streamu. Uchopte ikonu, aby ste vložili do časovej osi iba "
"zvukovú časť videa."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:39
msgid ""
"Clip Zone indicator. See :ref:`ui-monitors_cm_clip_zone` for more details."
msgstr ""
"Indikátor zóny klipu. Podrobnosti nájdete v :ref:`ui-monitors_cm_clip_zone`."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:41
msgid ""
"List of last opened clips. Hover with the mouse to the top and a list of "
"last opened clips appears. You can select a clip which then show up in the "
"clip monitor."
msgstr ""
"Zoznam naposledy otvorených klipov. Prejdite myšou na vrchol a zobrazí sa "
"zoznam naposledy otvorených klipov. Môžete vybrať klip, ktorý sa potom "
"zobrazí v monitore klipu."

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:43
msgid "Minimap for zooming the audio stream"
msgstr "Minimapa na priblíženie audio streamu"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors/clip_monitor.rst:45
msgid ""
"The action differs if the mouse is on the main view (upper part with the "
"video) or on the audio/minimap view."
msgstr ""
"Akcia sa líši podľa toho, či je myš na hlavnom zobrazení (horná časť s "
"videom) alebo na zobrazení zvuku/minimapy."

